Adds a reusable footer component with contact/feedback section, quick links, and branding to the main landing pages.

## Changes

- **New `contacts.py`** - Configurable team email list and feedback group email
- **New `templates/components/footer.html`** - Reusable footer with:
  - Brand section (logo, title, tagline)
  - Quick links (Home, Manual Form, Upload Resume, About)
  - Contact section with "Send Feedback" mailto button + 5 team member emails
  - Responsive CSS (3-column grid → single column on mobile)
- **Updated `intro.html`** - Replaced simple footer with new component
- **Updated `about.html`** - Added footer include

Footer intentionally excluded from form.html, upload_form.html, result.html, and roadmap.html per requirements.

## Usage

```html
{% include 'components/footer.html' %}
```

