- **Defensive signup handler** - Attaches to `#signupSubmit` with comprehensive error handling:
  - Validates required fields, email format, password length
  - Enforces unique username/email against `state.users`
  - Hashes password via `sha256Hex()` with fallback
  - Creates user with `uid()` or fallback ID generation
  - Persists via `saveState()` with localStorage fallback
  - Creates default business via `createBusinessForUser()` if available
  - Logs audit, closes modal, triggers video tour
  - Refreshes UI with fallbacks (`refreshSelectors()`, `renderAll()`, `updateAuthUI()`) or page reload as last resort

- **Z-index fix** - Hide pre-login overlay (z-index:9999) when opening signup modal (z-index:51) so modal is clickable

- **Modal lifecycle** - Cancel button and overlay click restore pre-login overlay when user is not logged in

- **Removed duplicate handler** - Replaced `initSignupModal()` submit handler with `initSignupModalCancel()` to prevent double user creation

